  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 401.05 \"National provider identifier\" means a unique identification number for certain health care providers issued by the national Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services through the National Plan and Provider Enumeration System.\n\nSource. #5624, eff 5-18-93, EXPIRED: 5-18-99\n\nNew. #8739, eff 10-11-06; ss by #9358, eff 1-10-09, EXPIRED: 1-10-17\n\nNew. #12107, INTERIM, eff 2-21-17, EXPIRED: 8-20-17\n\nNew. #12431, eff 12-8-17",
